# tam-font-set in comments) and the Foot notification id file's name.
# The shell size goes to ~/.local/state/tamlinux/shell.toml instead of the
# original's shell config, which tam-theme-payload merges last (plan 18 0.3.2
# item 9, D87), and the Tamlinux shell reloads its theme.
